  'is-ukhrul-worth-visiting-for-luira-phanit',
  'Is Ukhrul worth visiting for Luira Phanit?',
  '6/10 on our ledger for February — a real Tangkhul Naga New Year festival, in a genuinely cold month',
  'best-time',
  'brief',
  3,
  '/images/destinations/ukhrul.jpg',
